@startuml state_task
title Task Status State Diagram
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam stateBorderColor #999999

' ==================== STATES ====================
[*] --> PENDING : create_task()

state PENDING #LightBlue {
}

state RUNNING #LightGreen {
}

state COMPLETED #PaleGreen {
}

state FAILED #LightCoral {
}

state TIMEOUT #Orange {
}

state KILLED #Pink {
}

' ==================== TRANSITIONS ====================
PENDING --> RUNNING : execute() called\nacquire semaphore

RUNNING --> COMPLETED : exit_code == 0
RUNNING --> FAILED : exit_code != 0\n(syntax error, exception, etc.)
RUNNING --> TIMEOUT : CPU limit exceeded\n(exit_code 137 or -24)
RUNNING --> KILLED : kill_task() called\nor memory limit

COMPLETED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
TIMEOUT --> [*]
KILLED --> [*]

' ==================== NOTES ====================
note right of PENDING
  **Initial State**
  Task created, waiting
  for execution slot
end note

note right of RUNNING
  **Execution State**
  Docker container running
  Output streaming active
end note

note right of COMPLETED
  **Success**
  Code executed without error
  exit_code = 0
end note

note right of FAILED
  **Error State**
  - SyntaxError
  - ImportError (blocked module)
  - RuntimeError
  - Other exceptions
end note

note right of TIMEOUT
  **Time Limit**
  - CPU time exceeded (10s)
  - SIGXCPU signal
  - exit_code: 137 or -24
end note

note right of KILLED
  **Terminated**
  - Manual kill via API
  - Memory limit exceeded
  - SIGKILL signal
end note

' ==================== LEGEND ====================
note as legend
  **Exit Codes**
  0 = Success
  1 = Python exception
  137 = 128 + SIGKILL (9)
  -24 = SIGXCPU
  -9 = SIGKILL (memory)
end note

@enduml
